-# The three art states of an item in one place, so no screen has to re-derive
-# them: an uploaded image, one of the preset glyphs, or neither.
-#
-# Mirrors badges/_art. The fallback is the flask the notification rows have
-# always shown for an item with no artwork — one default across the app, not
-# one per screen.
- if item.upload?
  = image_tag item.icon, alt: ''
- elsif (glyph = gh_glyph(item.icon_glyph))
  = glyph
- else
  %i.fa-solid.fa-flask{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
